110-        <p class="text-gray-800 text-lg leading-relaxed">
111:            In a measure to streamline and enhance the admission processes, the Vice Chancellor is pleased to announce the re-constitution of the Central Admission Committee for the academic session 2024-25 and onwards. This committee is entrusted with the responsibility of overseeing the Admission Processes for all Undergraduate, Postgraduate, and Ph.D. programmes of the University, with the primary objective of ensuring a process that is both efficient and timely.
112-        </p>
